      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nThere appears to be a bug that is an inconsistency between the documented trace replay behavior and its implementation.\r\n\r\nThe trace replay documentation [vLLM Trace Replay](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/online_serving/trace_replay/?utm_source=chatgpt.com#usage) states that \r\n- `max_tokens` is automatically set to the trace length.\r\n- The trace is truncated if it does not fit within `max_model_len` given the prompt length.\r\n- Generation produces exactly the trace tokens, then stops.\r\n\r\nHowever, the current implementation uses `min(trace length, max_tokens)`. Since `max_tokens` defaults to 16, replay stops after 16 tokens for a longer trace. A smaller user-provided `max_tokens` causes the same issue. This PR sets `max_tokens` to the trace length after applying the `max_model_len` limit, which matches the documented behavior.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\r\n  tests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py -v\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Verify that the default `max_tokens=16` is overridden by a 20-token trace.\r\n- Verify that an explicitly specified `max_tokens=4` is overridden by a 20-token trace.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n```\r\ntests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py::test_normalize_trace_replay_params PASSED                                                                         [ 14%]\r\ntests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py::test_trace_length_overrides_default_max_tokens PASSED                                                             [ 28%]\r\ntests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py::test_trace_length_overrides_explicit_max_tokens PASSED                                                            [ 42%]\r\ntests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py::test_trace_longer_than_remaining_context_is_truncated PASSED                                                      [ 57%]\r\ntests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py::test_trace_request_rejected_when_feature_disabled PASSED                                                          [ 71%]\r\ntests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py::test_trace_request_accepted_when_feature_enabled PASSED                                                           [ 85%]\r\ntests/v1/engine/test_input_processor_trace_replay.py::test_trace_replay_requires_v2_model_runner PASSED                                                                 [100%]\r\n\r\n============================================================================== warnings summary ===============================================================================\r\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/jit/_script.py:365: 14 warnings\r\n  /data/home/xli49/lxy/vllm/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/jit/_script.py:365: DeprecationWarning: `torch.jit.script_method` is deprecated. Please switch to `torch.compile` or `torch.export`.\r\n    warnings.warn(\r\n\r\n-- Docs: https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/capture-warnings.html\r\n======================================================================= 7 passed, 14 warnings in 1.15s ========================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
